sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Utilisateur (connecté)
  actor A as Administrateur
  participant F as Angular (RecipeFormComponent)
  participant RS as RecipesService (Angular)
  participant C as RecipesController
  participant SV as RecipeService (backend)
  participant SL as RecipeSlugService
  participant R as RecipeRepository
  participant DB as MySQL

  Note over U, DB: Phase 1 — Création du brouillon
  U->>F: Remplit le formulaire recette
  F->>RS: createRecipe(formData)
  RS->>C: POST /api/v1/me/recipes
  C->>C: parseCreateRecipeBody(req.body)
  C->>SV: create(userId, input)
  SV->>SL: generateDraftSlug(title)
  SL-->>SV: slug temporaire
  SV->>R: create(recipeInput)
  R->>DB: INSERT INTO recipes (status = draft)
  DB-->>R: recipeId
  R-->>SV: Recipe
  SV-->>C: Recipe (status draft)
  C-->>RS: 201 { recipe }
  RS-->>F: Confirmation brouillon
  F-->>U: "Brouillon enregistré"

  Note over U, DB: Phase 2 — Soumission à la modération
  U->>F: Clique sur "Soumettre à la modération"
  F->>RS: submitRecipe(recipeId)
  RS->>C: POST /api/v1/me/recipes/:id/submit
  C->>SV: submit(recipeId, auth)
  SV->>SV: requireEditableRecipe(recipeId, auth)
  SV->>SL: createPublicSlug(title)
  SL->>R: existsBySlug(slug)
  R->>DB: SELECT 1 WHERE slug = ?
  DB-->>R: exists
  SL-->>SV: slug unique
  SV->>R: submit(recipeId, publicSlug)
  R->>DB: UPDATE status = pending
  DB-->>R: OK
  R-->>SV: Recipe (status pending)
  SV-->>C: Recipe
  C-->>RS: 200 { recipe }
  F-->>U: "En attente de validation"

  Note over A, DB: Phase 3 — Modération par l'admin
  A->>+C: GET /api/v1/admin/recipes
  C-->>-A: recettes en attente
  A->>+C: POST /api/v1/admin/recipes/:id/approve
  C->>SV: approve(recipeId, adminUserId)
  SV->>R: approve(recipeId, adminUserId)
  R->>DB: UPDATE status = published, publishedAt = NOW()
  DB-->>R: OK
  R-->>SV: Recipe (status published)
  SV-->>C: Recipe
  C-->>-A: 200 { recipe }
